+
+\item{k_folds}{single whole number in \verb{[2, nrow(counts)]}: SUITOR
+folds over the held-out cells.}
+
+\item{n_seeds}{single whole number \verb{>= 1}: best-of-n fits per fold.}
+
+\item{cv}{single logical: run layer 1? \code{FALSE} demotes the CV columns
